  <metadata>
    <name>D08_alt Voss → Tindevegen → Lom</name>
    <desc>264 km road, ≈5.9 h riding. Tindevegen instead of the Fodnes–Mannheller ferry, Sogndal and Skjolden. Private toll road from Øvre Årdal over 1315 m to Turtagrø, where it joins Rv55 Sognefjellet.</desc>
  </metadata>
